{"category": "LocationHint Location3", "line_index": 0, "text": "Gehe in die Küche."}
{"category": "LocationHint Location3", "line_index": 1, "text": "Schneide Karotten."}
{"category": "LocationHint Location3", "line_index": 2, "text": "Gehe ins Badezimmer, um die Schere zu holen."}
{"category": "LocationHint Location3", "line_index": 3, "text": "Gib Mita die Schere."}
{"category": "LocationHint Location3", "line_index": 4, "text": "Lege das Geschirr ins Spülbecken."}
